{"slug":"586607-soomavaara-baradirali","title":"ಸೋಮವಾರ ಬರದಿರಲಿ!","titleEn":"Soomavaara Baradirali","level":"3","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":547},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/586607-soomavaara-baradirali","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":586607,"authors":["Shabnam  Minwalla"],"illustrators":["Upasana Mehndiratta"],"translators":["Hema Khurshapur"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2023","originalStory":{"title":"On Mondays I Want to Hide"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Soomavaara Baradirali!’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org. This story was translated as part of a virtual translation hackathon that happened during May-June 2020.","attributionLine":"ಸೋಮವಾರ ಬರದಿರಲಿ! (Kannada), translated by Hema Khurshapur, based on original story On Mondays I Want to Hide, written by Shabnam  Minwalla, illustrated by Upasana Mehndiratta, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2023) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"An angry man with a moustache shouting","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Upasana Mehndiratta","year":"2021"},{"page":3,"title":"Children running in the playground","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":4,"title":"A lady drinking tea and talking","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":5,"title":"A sleepy girl","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"A girl in her school uniform","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A girl checking her bag","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"A kid with very long legs","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"A kid riding a bicycle","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"A happy girl","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"A girl waving her hand","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Two kids lying on a mat","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":13,"title":"An old man listening to music","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":14,"title":"A girl near a fan","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":15,"title":"A girl day dreaming","illustrator":"Upasana Mehndiratta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಸೋಮವಾರ ಒಬ್ಬ ವ್ಯಕ್ತಿ ಆಗಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅವರು ಶಾಲೆಯ ಪ್ರಿನ್ಸಿಪಾಲ್ ಆಗಿರೋರು.","ಅವರಿಗೆ ಮರಿಹುಳುಗಳಂತ ಹುಬ್ಬುಗಳಿರೋವು,","ಅವರಿಗೆ ಸುತ್ತಿಗೆಯಂತೆ ಗಟ್ಟಿಯಾದ ದನಿ ಇರೋದು.","“ಎದ್ದೇಳು, ಇದು ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡೋ ಸಮಯ,” ಎಂದು ಹೇಳಿರೋರು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಸೋಮವಾರ ಬಂದಾಗ, ನಾನು ಅಡಗಿಕೊಳ್ಳಲು ಬಯಸುತ್ತೇನೆ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮಂಗಳವಾರ ಒಬ್ಬ ಮಹಿಳೆಯಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ, ಅದು ವಯಸ್ಸಾದ ಚಿಕ್ಕಮ್ಮ ಆಗಿರೋದು.","ಅವರ ಸೀರೆಯು ಧೂಳಿನ ಬಣ್ಣದ್ದಾಗಿರುತ್ತಿತ್ತು.","ಪ್ರತಿವಾರ ಭೇಟಿ ನೀಡಿರೋರು. ಚಹಾ ಕುಡಿತಾ ಇರೋರು.","ಮಾತ್ ಆಡಿ, ಆಡಿ, ಆಡಿ... ಸಾಕು ಮಾಡಿರೋರು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾವು ಆಕಳಿಸುತ್ತ ಅವರು ಹೋಗುವುದನ್ನು ಕಾಯುತ್ತಿದ್ದೆವು.","ಮಂಗಳವಾರ ವಾರದ ಅತ್ಯಂತ ನಿಧಾನವಾದ ದಿನ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬುಧವಾರ ಒಬ್ಬ ಹುಡುಗಿಯಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ, ಅವಳು ನೇರಳೆ","ಕನ್ನಡಕವನ್ನು ಹಾಕ್ಕೊಂಡಿರೋಳು.","ಅಚ್ಚುಕಟ್ಟಾಗಿ ಸಮವಸ್ತ್ರ ಧರಿಸಿರೋಳು, ಮೂರು ಹರಿತವಾದ ಪೆನ್ಸಿಲ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಂಡು ಬಂದಿರೋಳು.","ಅವಳು ಪ್ರಶ್ನೆಗಳನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿರೋಳು, ಹಾಲು ಕುಡ್ದಿರೋಳು,","ಪಾಟಿಚೀಲ ಪ್ಯಾಕ್ ಮಾಡಿರೋಳು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬುಧವಾರ ಬಿಡುವಿಲ್ಲದ ದಿನ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಗುರುವಾರ ಒಬ್ಬ ಹುಡುಗನಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ,","ಅವನು ಹಳದಿ ಟಿ-ಶರ್ಟ್ ಧರಿಸಿರೋನು.","ಅವನ ಮನಸ್ಸಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಮ್ನಾಸ್ಟಿಕ್ಸ್ ಮತ್ತು","ಬಾಯಲ್ಲಿ ಲಾಲಿಪಾಪ್ ತುಂಬಿರೋದು.","ಅವನು ಜಿಗಿದು ಓಡಿರೋನು. ಅವಸರದಲ್ಲಿರೋನು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಗುರುವಾರದಂದು, ನಾನು ಖುಷಿ-ಖುಷಿಯಾದ ಯೋಜನೆಗಳನ್ನು ಮಾಡುವೆ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಶುಕ್ರವಾರ ದೊಡ್ಡಕ್ಕನಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ, ತನ್ನ ಫ್ರೆಂಡ್ಸ್‌ನ್ನು ಭೇಟಿಯಾಗಲು ತಯಾರಾಗಿರೋಳು. ಸಂತೋಷ ಸಂಭ್ರಮದಿಂದ ನಕ್ಕಿರೋಳು.","ಕಿವಿಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ನಕ್ಷತ್ರಗಳನ್ನು ಹಾಕ್ಕೊಂಡಿರೋಳು.","ಅವಳ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ತಾರೆಗಳ ಬೆಳಕಿರೋದು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ ನಾನು ಪ್ರತಿದಿನವೂ ಶುಕ್ರವಾರವಾಗಬೇಕೆಂದು ಬಯಸುತ್ತೇನೆ."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಶನಿವಾರದ ಹತ್ತಿರ ನಗು ಇದ್ದರೆ, ನನ್ನ","ಒಳ್ಳೆಯ ಸ್ನೇಹಿತೆಯಂತೆ ಇರೋದು.","ನಾವು ಕುಂಟೆಬಿಲ್ಲೆ ಆಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದೆವು.","ಪುಸ್ತಕಗಳನ್ನು ಓದುತ್ತಿದ್ದೆವು.","ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಕುಳಿತು ಮಳೆ ನೋಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದೆವು.","ಶನಿವಾರ ಮುಗಿಯಲೇಬಾರದು ಎನ್ನುವುದು ನನ್ನ ಬಯಕೆ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಭಾನುವಾರ ಬೋಳು ಅಜ್ಜನಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ.","ಊಟ ಮಾಡಿ ಮಲಗಿ ಕತೆ ಹೇಳಿರೋನು.","ಬೆಳಗ್ಗೆ ಖುಷಿ-ಖುಷಿಯಾಗಿ ಇರೋನು.","ಸಂಜೆ ಆಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದಂತೆ ಕಿರಿಕಿರಿ ಮಾಡಿರೋನು."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಭಾನುವಾರ ನಾನು ತಲೆ ತೊಳೆದುಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತೇನೆ.","ಸೋಮವಾರದ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ಯೋಚಿಸದಿರಲು ಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸುತ್ತೇನೆ."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586607-soomavaara-baradirali/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಸೋಮವಾರ","ಮಂಗಳವಾರ","ಬುಧವಾರ","ಗುರುವಾರ","ಶುಕ್ರವಾರ","ಶನಿವಾರ","ಭಾನುವಾರ","ವಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಮ್ಮ ನೆಚ್ಚಿನ ದಿನ ಯಾವುದು?"]}],"wordCount":188}